<title>USA: Dow Jones to sell subsidiary to Cowles.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones to sell subsidiary to Cowles.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dow Jones &amp; Co on Monday said it agreed to sell its American Demographics Inc subsidiary to Cowles Business Media Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>American Demographics, based in Ithaca, N.Y., publishes American Demographics and Marketing Tools magazines, the newsletter Forecast and a catalog of books and CD-ROMs, Dow Jones said.</p>
